    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are the lead qualification analyst for {{ $('⚙️ SETTINGS').first().json.cfg_company_name }}.\n\nWe offer: {{ $('⚙️ SETTINGS').first().json.cfg_services_offered }}\n\nScore the enquiry below. Score each of the 5 factors SEPARATELY using its own anchors below — do not blend them into one overall gut-feel number.\n\n=== ENQUIRY ===\nName: {{ $('Normalize Lead Fields').first().json.lead_name || 'not given' }}\nEmail: {{ $('Normalize Lead Fields').first().json.lead_email }}\nCompany: {{ $('Normalize Lead Fields').first().json.lead_company || 'not given' }}\nPhone given: {{ $('Normalize Lead Fields').first().json.lead_phone ? 'yes' : 'no' }}\nService requested: {{ $('Normalize Lead Fields').first().json.lead_service }}\nBudget: {{ $('Normalize Lead Fields').first().json.lead_budget }}\nTimeline: {{ $('Normalize Lead Fields').first().json.lead_timeline }}\nMessage: {{ $('Normalize Lead Fields').first().json.lead_message || 'no message provided' }}\nPreviously contacted us: {{ $json.is_returning ? 'YES - this is a repeat enquiry, treat as warmer' : 'no - first contact' }}\n\n=== SCORE EACH FACTOR SEPARATELY ===\n1. budget_score (0-30): 0 = no budget stated; 10-15 = vague or below typical project cost; 20-25 = budget stated and reasonable; 30 = budget stated and matches or exceeds typical cost for this service.\n2. timeline_score (0-25): 0 = no timeline or 'someday'/'not stated'; 8-12 = weeks to a couple months out; 18-20 = within a few weeks; 25 = ASAP, urgent, this week.\n3. service_score (0-20): 0 = unrelated to what we offer; 10 = loosely related; 20 = exact match to what we offer.\n4. message_score (0-15): 0 = one-liner, vague, or generic; 8 = some specific detail; 15 = detailed, specific, clear buying intent.\n5. contact_score (0-10): 0 = email only; 5 = email plus one of phone/company; 10 = email plus phone plus company.\n\nSpam, vague one-liners, job applications, sales pitches at us, or unrelated services: score every factor at or near 0 and set intent to \"spam_or_irrelevant\".\n\n=== USE THE TOTAL FOR REPLY TONE ONLY ===\nAdd your 5 scores together, plus 10 if this is a repeat enquiry (cap at 100). The workflow computes the official tier itself from your numbers — you do not output a tier. Use your own total only to decide how to write the reply, against these bands:\nhot  >= {{ $('⚙️ SETTINGS').first().json.cfg_hot_threshold }}\nwarm >= {{ $('⚙️ SETTINGS').first().json.cfg_warm_threshold }} and below hot\ncold = anything lower\n\n=== REPLY RULES ===\nWrite reply_body as plain text from {{ $('⚙️ SETTINGS').first().json.cfg_reply_from_name }}. Address them as {{ $('Normalize Lead Fields').first().json.first_name }}. Reference what they actually asked about. 90 words maximum. No markdown, no placeholders, no invented prices, no invented case studies.\nIf your total is hot: invite them to pick a time and end with this exact link on its own line: {{ $('⚙️ SETTINGS').first().json.cfg_booking_link }}\nIf your total is warm: answer helpfully and ask the one question that would qualify them.\nIf your total is cold: thank them politely and point them to our website. Do not invite a call.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "You are a precise B2B lead qualification engine. You output only the requested JSON object. You never invent facts about the company, its pricing, or its clients. You never exceed the stated word limits."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
